<title>NETHERLANDS: HAL 1996 FINAL NET PROFIT $102.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>HAL 1996 FINAL NET PROFIT $102.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (dollars)		1.61 vs   1.51</p>
<p>    Net profit			   102.3  vs  96.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (dollars)		   0.80 vs   0.70</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (dollars)   18.96 vs  13.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment group HAL Holding NV said in January it</p>
<p>expected a preliminary 1996 net profit of about $102 million and</p>
<p>said it would pay a $0.80 dividend.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
